            <ArticleTitle>Fracture of the inferior pole of the patella.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>658</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.2519/jospt.2012.0412</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The patient was a 19-year-old woman serving in the military at a remote location. She presented to a medical aid station with a chief complaint of right anterior knee pain after falling 3 hours prior from a height of 3 m and landing directly on the anterior aspect of her right knee.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
